{"2141620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Landiscape", "steam_appid": 2141620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Landiscape is aimed to be a fun and relaxed open world sandbox survival game to enjoy with up to 4 friends. Live your life as a safe farmer and grow your crops, or live your life as a raider where you scavenge the fallen world and wage war against all your enemies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squad up with your friends and hope that you can trust them, friendly fire is on. Landiscape has mobs ranging from classic zombies, large dino-like creatures, fast sprinting spiders, and even simple deer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141620/extras/a98f79f1e121ad70008c1c22f854201c.avif?t=1780668654\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141620/extras_big/a98f79f1e121ad70008c1c22f854201c.avif?t=1780668654 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runners charge without warning. Crawlers lurk in the shadows. Brutes crush through anything in their path. And it’s not just the infected—other survivors will do worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Landiscape drops you into a hostile open world where every sound, shadow, and choice could be your last:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge &amp; craft</strong>: Turn junk and salvage into weapons, gear, and life-saving tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build anywhere</strong>: Reinforce a gas station, wall off a grocery store, or make a forest bunker.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the undead</strong>: Face a dynamic AI horde that stalks, flanks, and evolves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt or be hunted</strong>: Fight for territory, supplies, and your next breath.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather. Fortify. Outlast.</strong><br>Nightfall brings no safety. In <i>Landiscape</i>, <strong>everything wants you dead.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Landiscape is aimed to be a fun and relaxed open world sandbox survival game to enjoy with up to 4 friends. Live your life as a safe farmer and grow your crops, or live your life as a raider where you scavenge the fallen world and wage war against all your enemies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squad up with your friends and hope that you can trust them, friendly fire is on. Landiscape has mobs ranging from classic zombies, large dino-like creatures, fast sprinting spiders, and even simple deer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141620/extras/a98f79f1e121ad70008c1c22f854201c.avif?t=1780668654\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141620/extras_big/a98f79f1e121ad70008c1c22f854201c.avif?t=1780668654 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runners charge without warning. Crawlers lurk in the shadows. Brutes crush through anything in their path. And it’s not just the infected—other survivors will do worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Landiscape drops you into a hostile open world where every sound, shadow, and choice could be your last:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge &amp; craft</strong>: Turn junk and salvage into weapons, gear, and life-saving tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build anywhere</strong>: Reinforce a gas station, wall off a grocery store, or make a forest bunker.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the undead</strong>: Face a dynamic AI horde that stalks, flanks, and evolves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt or be hunted</strong>: Fight for territory, supplies, and your next breath.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather. Fortify. Outlast.</strong><br>Nightfall brings no safety. In <i>Landiscape</i>, <strong>everything wants you dead.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Landiscape is a relaxed 1–4 player open-world survival sandbox set on a zombie-infested island. Build bases, scavenge resources, explore dangerous landmarks, grow crops, and survive together — or turn on your friends.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141620/e69582d126a8dec16f96480019dc0ad25c46045e/header.jpg?t=1780668654", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141620/db6cad7efddb0467e2d1b0209b818e345e4f3e14/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780668654", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141620/db6cad7efddb0467e2d1b0209b818e345e4f3e14/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780668654", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-3225 3.3 GHz or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4000 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX Compatible</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7300U 3.5 GHz or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Mem